    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναγν-ωστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>capable of reading, a good reader,</i>
